{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-06-15 10:54:00', 'title': 'GEORGIA POWER OFFERS TIPS, TOOLS FOR CUSTOMERS DURING FIRST HEAT WAVE OF SUMMER', 'text': 'ATLANTA , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH AFTERNOON HIGH TEMPERATURES SOARING INTO THE MID-90S THIS WEEK ACROSS THE STATE, GEORGIA POWER IS PREPARED TO MEET THE INCREASED DEMAND FOR ELECTRICITY AND ENCOURAGES CUSTOMERS TO TAKE MEASURES AROUND THE HOUSE TO HELP MINIMIZE THE IMPACT OF THE HIGHER TEMPERATURES ON ELECTRIC BILLS. TIPS, TOOLS & RESOURCES GEORGIA POWER OFFERS EFFICIENCY TIPS AND TOOLS THAT CAN HELP ALL CUSTOMERS SAVE MONEY AND ENERGY THROUGHOUT THE YEAR.'}